# Layout for Mr. Game's video games with a 256x248 CRT (Dakar, Motor Show, Mac Attack, World Cup 90)

Width: 256
Height: 248
Fit: Contain

Visuals:
	- Screen:
		Rect: [0,0,256,248]
		Style: CRT
		Size: [256, 248]
		Glass:
			Roughness: 0.1
			Image:     ./Glass-Dirty-1.webp
			Area:      [384,132,256,248]
			Ambient:   [0.2,0.2,0.2]
